{"seq":1,"slug":"caching-fundamentals","title":"缓存原理与价值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/caching-systems-design/foundations/caching-fundamentals","wordCount":1917,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"缓存原理与价值\">缓存原理与价值</h1><p>把一份计算或读取的结果暂存到「离使用者更近、访问更快」的地方，下次同样的请求直接拿现成结果——这就是缓存。它不创造新数据，只是用空间换时间、用一份冗余副本换掉一段昂贵的延迟。理解缓存，先要理解它存在的物理前提：现代计算机系统的存储介质在速度与容量上存在数量级的鸿沟，而缓存正是横跨这道鸿沟的桥。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>缓存的本质是一条「存储层级（memory hierarchy）」链。越靠近 CPU/请求方，速度越快、容量越小、单位成本越高；越远离，则相反。一次请求若在某层命中（hit），就立即返回；若未命中（miss），就向下一层穿透，直到命中或抵达权威数据源（source of truth，如数据库、对象存储）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[请求方&lt;br/&gt;应用线程] --&gt; B[L1/L2 CPU 缓存&lt;br/&gt;约 1-10 ns]&#10;  B --&gt; C[进程内本地缓存&lt;br/&gt;堆内对象 约 100 ns]&#10;  C --&gt; D[分布式缓存&lt;br/&gt;Redis/Memcached 约 0.5-1 ms]&#10;  D --&gt; E[数据库&lt;br/&gt;磁盘/SSD 约 5-50 ms]&#10;  E --&gt; F[远端对象存储/外部 API&lt;br/&gt;数十至数百 ms]\">flowchart TD\n  A[请求方&lt;br/&gt;应用线程] --&gt; B[L1/L2 CPU 缓存&lt;br/&gt;约 1-10 ns]\n  B --&gt; C[进程内本地缓存&lt;br/&gt;堆内对象 约 100 ns]\n  C --&gt; D[分布式缓存&lt;br/&gt;Redis/Memcached 约 0.5-1 ms]\n  D --&gt; E[数据库&lt;br/&gt;磁盘/SSD 约 5-50 ms]\n  E --&gt; F[远端对象存储/外部 API&lt;br/&gt;数十至数百 ms]</pre><p>各存储层级的典型量级差异，是缓存全部价值的根源：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>典型访问延迟</th>\n<th>相对容量</th>\n<th>单位成本</th>\n<th>易失性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CPU L1/L2 缓存</td>\n<td>约 1–10 ns</td>\n<td>KB–MB</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>易失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主内存（DRAM）</td>\n<td>约 100 ns</td>\n<td>GB</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>易失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进程内本地缓存</td>\n<td>约 100 ns–1 μs</td>\n<td>GB</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>易失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分布式内存缓存</td>\n<td>约 0.5–1 ms（含网络）</td>\n<td>TB</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>可选持久化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本地 SSD/NVMe</td>\n<td>约 50–150 μs</td>\n<td>TB</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>持久</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据库查询</td>\n<td>约 5–50 ms</td>\n<td>TB–PB</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>持久</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意「ns→ms」跨越六个数量级。一次内存访问与一次跨网络数据库查询的差距，相当于「走到隔壁房间」与「飞越半个地球」。缓存把热点访问从右侧昂贵层级搬到左侧廉价层级，这就是它能让系统快上几十倍的物理原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缓存带来的三类收益\">缓存带来的三类收益</h2><p>第一类是<strong>延迟收益</strong>。把单次读取从一次数据库往返（含连接获取、SQL 解析、磁盘 I/O、结果序列化）压缩成一次内存查表，P99 延迟往往从几十毫秒降到亚毫秒。对用户而言这是页面「秒开」与「转圈」的区别。</p>\n<p>第二类是<strong>吞吐与成本收益</strong>。数据库的连接数、磁盘 IOPS、CPU 都是稀缺且昂贵的资源。缓存挡在前面后，到达数据库的请求量被命中率压低一个量级，意味着同样的数据库实例能支撑十倍的前端流量，或反过来用更小的实例省下硬件开销。命中率与流量的关系会在 <a href=\"locality-hit-ratio\">局部性与命中率</a> 中量化。</p>\n<p>第三类是<strong>保护与稳定性收益</strong>。缓存是数据库的「缓冲垫」。突发流量先打在缓存上，数据库免于被瞬时洪峰击穿。但这层保护是双刃剑——一旦缓存失效不当，反而会把洪峰一次性放给数据库，这正是 <a href=\"../advanced/cache-failures\">缓存穿透击穿雪崩</a> 要解决的核心难题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缓存的代价-一致性与复杂度\">缓存的代价：一致性与复杂度</h2><p>天下没有免费的缓存。引入一份副本，就引入了「副本与权威数据可能不一致」的根本矛盾。Phil Karlton 那句广为流传的话——「计算机科学只有两件难事：缓存失效与命名」——正是在说这件事。缓存写入后，源数据一旦变更，缓存里的值就「陈旧（stale）」了。如何让它及时失效、能容忍多大程度的陈旧，是缓存设计的核心权衡，详见 <a href=\"../eviction-expiry/consistency-staleness\">一致性与陈旧度</a>。</p>\n<p>除一致性外，缓存还带来运维复杂度：多一层组件就多一处故障点、多一套监控、多一份内存预算。是否值得缓存，取决于「读写比」与「重复访问度」。一条被读一万次、几乎不变的配置，缓存价值极高；一条写完即读一次的日志，缓存毫无意义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"何时该缓存-何时不该\">何时该缓存，何时不该</h2><p>一个实用的判断框架围绕三个问题展开。其一，<strong>读多写少吗？</strong> 读写比越高，缓存摊薄到每次读的失效成本越低。其二，<strong>能容忍陈旧吗？</strong> 商品库存的实时性要求远高于用户头像；前者可能根本不该缓存或需极短 TTL。其三，<strong>重复度高吗？</strong> 若每个 key 几乎只被访问一次（如随机生成的一次性令牌），缓存命中率趋近于零，徒增内存浪费。</p>\n<p>下面用一个简化模型量化收益。设缓存命中率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>，命中时延迟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，未命中时延迟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（含回源），则平均访问延迟为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{avg} = h \\cdot t_c + (1-h) \\cdot (t_c + t_d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>代入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext> ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_c = 1\\ \\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mtext> ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_d = 20\\ \\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h = 0.9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.9</span></span></span></span></span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mtext> ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{avg} = 1 + 0.1 \\times 20 = 3\\ \\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span>，相比无缓存的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>21</mn><mtext> ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">21\\ \\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">21</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span> 提速近七倍。这个公式揭示一个反直觉的事实：命中率从 90% 提到 99% 带来的边际收益（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{avg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 从 3 ms 降到 1.2 ms）远大于从 50% 提到 60%，因为未命中项的权重是非线性的。命中率工程因此值得投入，方法见 <a href=\"../eviction-expiry/eviction-policies\">淘汰策略</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缓存的多层形态\">缓存的多层形态</h2><p>缓存不是某个特定组件，而是一种思想，它在系统的几乎每一层都有化身。理解这一点，能帮你在设计时识别「这里其实可以缓存」的机会。下面这张图把同一思想在不同层级的体现并列起来：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缓存形态</th>\n<th>所在层级</th>\n<th>缓存什么</th>\n<th>谁来管理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CPU 缓存</td>\n<td>硬件</td>\n<td>内存行（cache line）</td>\n<td>硬件自动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>页缓存（page cache）</td>\n<td>操作系统</td>\n<td>磁盘块</td>\n<td>内核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进程内本地缓存</td>\n<td>应用进程</td>\n<td>堆内对象、计算结果</td>\n<td>应用/缓存库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分布式缓存</td>\n<td>独立服务</td>\n<td>序列化的键值</td>\n<td>Redis/Memcached</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HTTP/浏览器缓存</td>\n<td>客户端</td>\n<td>HTTP 响应</td>\n<td>浏览器 + 缓存头</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CDN 边缘缓存</td>\n<td>网络边缘</td>\n<td>静态资源、可缓存响应</td>\n<td>CDN 厂商</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些形态从硬件到全球网络跨越巨大尺度，但回答的是同一个问题——把昂贵访问的结果就近暂存。一个真实系统往往同时叠加多层：浏览器缓存挡掉重复请求、CDN 挡掉跨洲回源、进程内本地缓存挡掉网络往返、分布式缓存挡掉数据库查询。每多一层，就多挡掉一段延迟，但也多一处可能陈旧的副本——这条「多级缓存」的脉络贯穿整个 hub，从本地的 <a href=\"cache-patterns\">缓存读写模式</a> 一直延伸到全球的 <a href=\"../advanced/cdn-edge-caching\">CDN 与边缘缓存</a>。</p>\n<p>值得强调的是，越靠近硬件的缓存越自动、越难干预（CPU 缓存几乎全由硬件托管），越靠近应用与网络的缓存越需要工程师显式设计——而本 hub 聚焦的，正是后者这片「需要你做决策」的领域：缓存什么、放哪一层、留多久、如何失效、怎样防故障。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>缓存用一份就近、快速的冗余副本换取延迟、吞吐与稳定性，根源是存储层级在速度与成本上的数量级鸿沟。</li>\n<li>三类收益——延迟、吞吐/成本、稳定性——都依赖足够高的命中率，而命中率非线性地放大收益。</li>\n<li>代价是一致性矛盾与运维复杂度；引入缓存等于引入「副本可能陈旧」的根本问题。</li>\n<li>是否缓存取决于读写比、陈旧容忍度、重复访问度三个维度，不满足时缓存反成负担。</li>\n<li>平均延迟模型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{avg} = h t_c + (1-h)(t_c + t_d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是评估缓存价值的最小工具，后续各章都在围绕「如何把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 做高、把不一致控制住」展开。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"缓存原理与价值","id":"缓存原理与价值"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存带来的三类收益","id":"缓存带来的三类收益"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存的代价：一致性与复杂度","id":"缓存的代价-一致性与复杂度"},{"level":2,"text":"何时该缓存，何时不该","id":"何时该缓存-何时不该"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存的多层形态","id":"缓存的多层形态"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"局部性与命中率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/caching-systems-design/foundations/locality-hit-ratio"}}